                <pb facs="0837" n="755" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg755"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 831.415 A/31.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of Venezuela
                        to the President.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-07-06"><hi rendition="#italic">July 6,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In the name of the people of Venezuela and in my own I thankfully acknowledge the
                    felicitations Your Excellency sends me on the occasion of the celebration of the
                    first centennial of our independence. Accept my best wishes for the growing
                    prosperity of the great American Nation and Your Excellency’s personal
                    happiness.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Juan Vicente
                    Gómez.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
